// __shfl(vlane, kk) broadcasts V[kk,r] to all lanes; each lane does 32 FMAs
// W[kk] += V[kk,r] * a_rc into 32 INDEPENDENT accumulators (intra-warp ILP)
// while the MB warps give inter-matrix occupancy. T is staged in smem (small,
// reused BLK times). YT lives in 32 regs. Sweep 2 mirrors sweep 1.
//
// Grid = (cdiv(ncols, 32), cdiv(B, MB)); block = MB*32 threads.
// A_ptr read source (block 0: A for clone fusion), Aout store dest (H).
// Vt[bid,k,r] is the V^T buffer (same layout the Triton kernel reads), T BLKxBLK.
